Item icons

caipirinha.svg, coxinha.svg, pao_de_queijo.svg, acai.svg, and pastel.svg are
original Dividimos artwork.

Every other icon in this directory is a Flat-style asset from Microsoft Fluent
Emoji (https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji), renamed to its item icon
key, and used under the MIT License below:

beer.svg           Beer mug
bread.svg          Bread
burger.svg         Hamburger
chicken.svg        Poultry leg
cocktail.svg       Cocktail glass
coffee.svg         Hot beverage
dessert.svg        Shortcake
fish.svg           Fish
fries.svg          French fries
fruit.svg          Red apple
hot_dog.svg        Hot dog
ice_cream.svg      Soft ice cream
juice.svg          Beverage box
meat.svg           Cut of meat
other.svg          Receipt
pasta.svg          Spaghetti
pizza.svg          Pizza
plate.svg          Fork and knife with plate
produce.svg        Leafy green
salad.svg          Green salad
sandwich.svg       Sandwich
seafood.svg        Shrimp
snacks.svg         Popcorn
soda.svg           Cup with straw
soup.svg           Steaming bowl
spirits.svg        Tumbler glass
sushi.svg          Sushi
sweets.svg         Chocolate bar
water.svg          Droplet
wine.svg           Wine glass

